.TH MCP-SERVER-DATOVKA 1 "July 2026" "mcp-server-datovka" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mcp-server-datovka \- MCP server exposing the Czech ISDS Data Box system
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mcp-server-datovka
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mcp-server-datovka
is a Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that exposes the Czech ISDS
("Datové schránky" / Data Box) system as tools for an LLM agent.
It communicates over stdio using the MCP protocol and is intended to be
launched by an MCP client (e.g. Claude Code, Claude Desktop, or any other
MCP-compatible agent runtime), not run interactively.
.PP
It is built on
.B fastmcp
and
.BR python3-datovka (7),
a ctypes wrapper around
.BR libdatovka (7).
.SH TOOLS
The server exposes the following MCP tools:
.TP
.B list_received_messages(limit=20)
Summaries of received messages, most recent first.
.TP
.B list_sent_messages(limit=20)
Summaries of sent messages, most recent first.
.TP
.B get_message(message_id, include_attachment_content=False)
Full message with documents; attachment bytes are base64-encoded and only
included on request.
.TP
.B mark_message_read(message_id)
Mark a received message as read.
.TP
.B send_message(recipient_box_id, subject, attachments, ...)
Send a new message with file attachments.
.TP
.B send_text_message(recipient_box_id, subject, body)
Compose plain text as a PDF and send it as the message's main document.
.TP
.B find_data_box(query, limit=10)
Look up a recipient's data box ID by name, trade name, or IČO, using
the offline
.B seznamds
directory first and falling back to the live ISDS search API.
.TP
.B ping()
Verify the session is alive.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B DATOVKA_URL
ISDS SOAP endpoint URL. Optional; defaults to the production endpoint
(trailing slash required).
.TP
.B DATOVKA_USERNAME
ISDS login username. Required.
.TP
.B DATOVKA_PASSWORD
ISDS login password. Required.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/lib/seznamds/seznam_ds_*.xml
Offline Czech data-box directory, used by
.B find_data_box
when the optional
.B seznamds
package is installed.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR python3-datovka (7),
.BR libdatovka (7)
